# Dev-only tools for the dev stage of the Dockerfile (not in the production image). Edit this
# file, then regenerate requirements-dev.txt with scripts/compile_lock.py.
#
# The production lock is the constraint, so the dev lock only adds packages and never changes
# a production version. Empty for now: the dev stage installs no extra Python packages
# (it adds only Debian packages); add tools here when needed.
-c requirements.txt
